      {
        "text": "Judge Marubio presides over the Second Municipal District and is deputy chief of First Appearance Court. Appointed in 2016 and elected in 2020, she led the Pretrial Division as it ended cash bail. She was previously an administrative law judge, a criminal defense attorney, and president of the Alliance of Illinois Judges. In 2020, she denied bail for a getaway driver in a fatal shooting.",
